    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        269.067138671875,
        513.3916015625,
        282.41864013671875
      ],
      "text": "To allow the currently available fixed-dose combinations (FDCs) to be used to achieve",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        285.06365966796875,
        513.448974609375,
        298.4151611328125
      ],
      "text": "the desirable doses of anti-TB drugs for children, WHO has compiled the dosing charts",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        301.0601806640625,
        380.7044677734375,
        314.41168212890625
      ],
      "text": "in this annex as an interim measure, based on the following:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        325.5710144042969,
        513.440673828125,
        338.9225158691406
      ],
      "text": "Quality-assured dispersible tablets should be used wherever possible, especially for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        329.242919921875,
        91.36740112304688,
        337.242919921875
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        341.5675048828125,
        312.9955749511719,
        354.91900634765625
      ],
      "text": "children who cannot swallow solid tablets.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        363.5710144042969,
        513.3717041015625,
        376.9225158691406
      ],
      "text": "Regimens are based on FDCs, but in some cases may also require administration of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        367.242919921875,
        91.36740112304688,
        375.242919921875
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        379.5675048828125,
        242.0634765625,
        392.91900634765625
      ],
      "text": "single-component products.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        401.5710144042969,
        513.4520874023438,
        414.9225158691406
      ],
      "text": "These doses are for once a day dosing regimens and, wherever possible, avoid the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        405.242919921875,
        91.36740112304688,
        413.242919921875
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        417.5675048828125,
        227.5619659423828,
        430.91900634765625
      ],
      "text": "need for splitting tablets.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        439.5710144042969,
        513.39453125,
        452.9225158691406
      ],
      "text": "The recommended doses are generally below the upper limit of the dose ranges to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        443.242919921875,
        91.36740112304688,
        451.242919921875
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        455.5675048828125,
        221.9844970703125,
        468.91900634765625
      ],
      "text": "minimize risk of toxicity.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        477.5670166015625,
        513.440673828125,
        490.91851806640625
      ],
      "text": "These guidelines replace the interim recommendations published by WHO in 2009:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        493.4945068359375,
        513.4750366210938,
        506.9150085449219
      ],
      "text": "Dosing instructions for the use of currently available fixed-dose combination TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        509.4909973144531,
        196.21298217773438,
        522.9114990234375
      ],
      "text": "medicines for children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        534.0664672851562,
        513.383056640625,
        547.41796875
      ],
      "text": "Once children achieve a body weight of 25 kg, adult dosage recommendations can be",
